    "preamble": "The State Of Madhya Pradesh Through Shri ... vs Dharmendra Sethana on 21 November, 2019 Author: Sunil Kumar Awasthi Bench: Sunil Kumar Awasthi M.Cr.C. No.38628/2019 The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh M.Cr.C. No.38628/2019 (The State of Madhya Pradesh vs. Dharmendra Sethana) Indore, Dated:21/11/2019 Shri Yogesh Kumar Gupta, learned Public Pro the applicant/State.",
    "facts": "It is a disputed fact that Food and Safety Officer has taken the sample from the respondent/accused on 14/02/2012, however, the charge-sheet has been filed on 22/08/2013 i.e. after a lapse of one year from the date of occurrence.",
